  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Whatever. It's just a dream, I can do whatever I want.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: With a cunning smile, I fake missing the correct hole,
      quickly sliding the tip of my penis until I reach my final destination. To
      my surprise, it slips inside without any resistance, her inner walls stretching
      to accomodate my length.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>O-oh, you sly rascal...
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#99DDFF>Did I hurt you?
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Not at all. I don't mind. I am just amused
      by your boldness.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: To emphasize her words, she actually bucks up her lower
      body, suckng me in even more. She then lays two of her claws on my back, preventing
      me from pulling out.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>So adventurous, I love it. I suppose we
      can skip the formalities, then.
    TextAlignment: 260
